{"key": "d5be0c09dceb0a97226916f56dd49b24", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "O Crediário da Getnet aceita parcelamento em até 48 vezes no cartão de crédito [1][3].\n\nQuanto à taxa de juros para o cliente, as fontes dizem apenas que ela varia de acordo com o emissor do cartão [1]. O prazo máximo e a taxa de juros do parcelamento também dependem do emissor [3]. Para o lojista, a taxa de desconto (MDR) pode ser consultada no Aplicativo Getnet Brasil ou no Portal do cliente [1]. As fontes não trazem um percentual específico de juros para o cliente.\n\nMISSING: percentual de juros do Crediário para o cliente (varia por emissor)", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUkvUWPU7b7Qh3KKm1z", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4815, "output_tokens": 233, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-03#0"}
{"key": "55467ccb55e2a6f36f91f6eca3b40796", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Yes, the Payment Link can be used through WhatsApp. Getnet describes it as a link you create and send to your customer, which is ideal for sales via WhatsApp and social media [1]. The product page also says you can sell using WhatsApp or your social network [2].\n\nThe sources I have don't state a daily sales cap for the Payment Link. They only describe pricing, such as the Inicial plan at R$1,00 per paid link and the Básico plan at R$28/month with 60 card transactions [3].\n\nMISSING: daily sales limit of the Payment Link", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUm6Buyw3SK5TDEdxcJ", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4956, "output_tokens": 182, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-04#0"}
{"key": "78d24537224a1314d5607d3a3d5cd3f8", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "The Get Clássica costs R$ 79,90/month [1][2][5].\n\nThe passages give battery advice only for the Get Smart, not the Get Clássica. They say to charge it for at least 3 hours in a row and to recharge at 20% [3]. They don't state the Get Clássica's battery life in hours.\n\nMISSING: Get Clássica battery life in hours", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUm9JS46DTzbPw5XS3b", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4978, "output_tokens": 121, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-02#0"}
{"key": "56cb1564679d3a148c780b7f9910a548", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "A Get Smart custa R$ 129,90/mês, segundo a página de ofertas da Getnet [1][5]. Pelo que as fontes explicam, a Getnet cobra o aluguel e as Taxas Administrativas. As mensalidades dos aplicativos são cobradas pelas empresas desenvolvedoras [4].\n\nAs passagens não trazem o prazo de garantia da Get Smart em meses.\n\nMISSING: garantia da Get Smart em meses", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUm8YneBetPFd8zdDux", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4892, "output_tokens": 160, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-01#0"}
{"key": "4d3fe261ca94a15f11875c3ec6ff578b", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "O Crediário da Getnet aceita parcelamento em até 48 vezes no cartão de crédito [prod-crediario-03][prod-crediario-02].\n\nA taxa de juros para o cliente varia conforme o emissor do cartão. O prazo máximo e a taxa também dependem do emissor [prod-crediario-02][prod-crediario-03]. As fontes não trazem um percentual específico de juros. Para o lojista, a taxa de desconto (MDR) pode ser consultada no Aplicativo Getnet Brasil ou no Portal do cliente [prod-crediario-03].\n\nSe quiser, posso encaminhar você a um atendente humano para detalhar mais.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUm6wYyEWzgPnSBzhuU", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3628, "output_tokens": 232, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-partial-03#0"}
{"key": "812c17893456ab9164d3388cabcf2ed0", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Sim, as fontes indicam que o Pix funciona com conta. O Pix pode ser feito por conta corrente, poupança ou conta de pagamento pré-paga entre diferentes bancos [4]. A Get Conta é uma conta digital gratuita para empresas, e com ela você consegue enviar e receber dinheiro e vender por meio do Pix [1]. Dentro da Get Conta, a opção Pix permite transferir com chave, com leitura de QR Code ou com número de agência e conta [2].\n\nSobre o prazo de abertura, as fontes não trazem quanto tempo leva para abrir a Get Conta. Elas só falam do prazo de recebimento das vendas, que é de até 2 dias úteis depois da abertura, contados da data das transações e da conclusão do cadastro [3].\n\nMISSING: prazo de abertura da Get Conta", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUmCc7VqH4z3mBsLuTA", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4921, "output_tokens": 295, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-05#0"}
{"key": "848a0369544a2e103b88fb72c9a4bd68", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Yes, you can send the Payment Link through WhatsApp. Getnet describes it as a link you create and send to your customer, which suits sales via WhatsApp and social media [prod-pagamentos-pelo-whatsapp-02][prod-link-de-pagamento-01].\n\nThe sources don't state a daily sales cap for the Payment Link. They only cover pricing. For example, the Inicial plan costs R$1,00 per paid link, and the Básico plan costs R$28/month with 60 card transactions [prod-link-de-pagamento-02]. I can hand you to a human agent to confirm the cap if you'd like.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUmGgSMKLAaZVAP78Le", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3538, "output_tokens": 207, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-partial-04#0"}
{"key": "bbf3a595f594f1ca68fd496bd8808d38", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "The Get Clássica costs R$ 79,90/month [prod-ofertas-maquininha-11][prod-todas-as-maquininhas-04][prod-get-tap-03].\n\nI couldn't find its battery life in hours in the sources. They give battery advice only for the Get Smart: charge it for at least 3 hours in a row and recharge at 20% [sup-duvidas-get-smart-03]. That advice isn't confirmed for the Get Clássica.\n\nI can hand you to a human agent if you want the exact battery life.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUmHmBBpb4X5AJcWAi8", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3428, "output_tokens": 175, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-partial-02#0"}
{"key": "2a1c7afe3275e61f499f65b22bc6549c", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "A Get Smart custa R$ 129,90/mês, segundo a página de ofertas da Getnet [prod-ofertas-maquininha-11][prod-todas-as-maquininhas-04]. A Getnet cobra o aluguel e as Taxas Administrativas. As mensalidades dos aplicativos são cobradas pelas empresas desenvolvedoras [sup-duvidas-get-smart-12].\n\nAs fontes não informam o prazo de garantia da Get Smart em meses. Se quiser, posso encaminhar você a um atendente humano para confirmar esse prazo.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghUmKPucc1zp4BanitjV", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3515, "output_tokens": 200, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-partial-01#0"}
